@gateway = http://localhost:5000
@authBenzinId = 2685b888-f1f4-4ee8-bcee-bc2a896dbd70

### 1) Kart okutuldu (Gateway -> Sale -> Loyalty)
POST {{gateway}}/authorizations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cardNumber": "1000200030004000", "fuelType": "Benzin", "stationCode": "IST-001", "pumpNo": 1 }

### 2) Satýþ bitti (Gateway -> Sale -> RabbitMQ -> Loyalty)
POST {{gateway}}/sales
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "authorizationId": "{{authBenzinId}}",
  "stationCode": "IST-001",
  "cardNumber": "1000200030004000",
  "fuelType": "Benzin",
  "liters": 40.5,
  "amount": 2150.75
}

### 3) Kart durumu (Gateway -> Loyalty)
GET {{gateway}}/cards/1000200030004000

### 4) Dýþarýya kapalý endpoint -> 404 beklenir
POST {{gateway}}/cards/authorize
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cardNumber": "1000200030004000", "fuelType": "Benzin", "stationCode": "IST-001", "pumpNo": 1 }

### Kart listesi
GET {{gateway}}/admin/cards

### Doðrulama hatasý -> 400 ve alan bazlý hata listesi
POST {{gateway}}/admin/cards
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cardNumber": "12AB", "holderName": "", "allowedFuelType": "Benzin", "limitType": "Amount", "balance": -5 }

### Olmayan kart -> 404 ProblemDetails
GET {{gateway}}/cards/9999999999

### Satýþ raporu (tümü)
GET {{gateway}}/admin/sales

### Satýþ raporu (filtreli)
GET {{gateway}}/admin/sales?stationCode=IST-001&fuelType=Benzin

### Geçersiz tarih aralýðý -> 400
GET {{gateway}}/admin/sales?from=2026-12-31&to=2026-01-01

### Doðrulama hatasý (litre 0, kart no hatalý) -> 400
POST {{gateway}}/sales
Content-Type: application/json

{ "authorizationId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "stationCode": "IST-001", "cardNumber": "12", "fuelType": "Benzin", "liters": 0, "amount": 100 }

### Pompa no hatalý -> 400 (artýk Sale kendisi reddediyor)
POST {{gateway}}/authorizations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cardNumber": "1000200030004000", "fuelType": "Benzin", "stationCode": "IST-001", "pumpNo": 0 }